SKILL.md	md	delete-after	## Isolation Gate (HARD RULE — before Phase 5 Implement)
SKILL.md	md	gone	
SKILL.md	md	gone	No feature code is written in the primary checkout. Before the first wave of
SKILL.md	md	gone	Phase 5, the feature MUST be moved into its own git worktree on a fresh branch off
SKILL.md	md	gone	`main`. This prevents the parallel-session corruption class: two sessions editing
SKILL.md	md	gone	the same working tree overwrite each other's files and push half-finished work
SKILL.md	md	gone	(e.g. a referenced type that was never committed) to `main`, leaving it build-red.
SKILL.md	md	gone	
SKILL.md	md	gone	1. **Create the worktree** (delegate to the `a1-worktree` skill, or inline):
SKILL.md	md	gone	   ```bash
SKILL.md	md	gone	   git -C <repo> fetch origin main
SKILL.md	md	gone	   git -C <repo> worktree add ../a1-worktrees/<feature-slug> -b feature/<feature-slug> origin/main
SKILL.md	md	gone	   ```
SKILL.md	md	gone	   Every wave's edits, builds, and tests happen inside that worktree path.
SKILL.md	md	gone	2. **Implement wave by wave** there. After each wave, build + tests must be GREEN
SKILL.md	md	gone	   in the worktree before the next wave.
SKILL.md	md	gone	3. **Merge via PR** only after the final wave is GREEN (typically after Phase 6
SKILL.md	md	gone	   Verify passes): hand the worktree to `a1-pr-review`
SKILL.md	md	gone	   (`a1-worktree exit --mode handoff`). It pushes the branch, opens the PR, runs
SKILL.md	md	gone	   the review, and squash-merges (`gh pr merge <n> --squash --delete-branch`). No
SKILL.md	md	gone	   local merge into `main`, no `git push origin main`.
SKILL.md	md	gone	   If `origin/main` no longer builds for reasons unrelated to this feature:
SKILL.md	md	gone	   STOP, do NOT layer on top, report to Robert.
SKILL.md	md	gone	4. **Tear down** the worktree: done by `a1-pr-review` after the merge — do not
SKILL.md	md	gone	   exit it a second time here.
SKILL.md	md	gone	
SKILL.md	md	gone	**Never** cherry-pick commits onto a fresh main branch as a merge workaround.
SKILL.md	md	gone	**Never** push a build-red `main`. **Never** edit the primary checkout mid-feature
SKILL.md	md	gone	while another session may hold it.
SKILL.md	md	gone	
